{
    "title": "RentRedi for Tenants & Owners",
    "description": "RentRedi offers an award-winning, comprehensive property management platform that simplifies the renting process for landlords and renters by automating and streamlining processes.\r\n\r\nLandlord features:\r\n\r\n\u2022\u2003Online and mobile rent payments\r\n\u2022\u2003Custom applications and prequalifications\r\n\u2022\u2003TransUnion-certified background checks, criminal history, and eviction reports\r\n\u2022\u2003Proof of Income Verification certified by Plaid\r\n\u2022\u2003Auto rent reminders and late fees\r\n\u2022\u2003Accept partial or block payments\r\n\u2022\u2003Listings on Zillow, Trulia, HotPads, Realtor.com\u00ae\r\n\u2022\u2003Unlimited units, tenants, listings\r\n\r\nTenant features:\r\n\r\n\u2022\u2003Pay rent from your phone\r\n\u2022\u2003Pay rent with cash\r\n\u2022\u2003Apply & submit screenings\r\n\u2022\u2003Report maintenance issues to your landlord\r\n\u2022\u2003Protect your property with renter\u2019s insurance\r\n\u2022\u2003Use rent to boost your credit score\r\n\u2022\u2003E-sign leases on your phone\r\n\u2022\u2003Receive in-app landlord notifications",
